      "title": "How to Cut AI Agent Cost Per Task by 60x",
      "summary": "Enterprises are capping engineer budgets at $1,500/month and burning annual AI budgets in four months — not because tokens are expensive, but because stochastic agents generate 5–30x more of them per task than necessary. Replacing decision loops with rule-based execution cuts AI agent cost per task by up to 60x. Primary-data comparison across Gartner, Forrester, Layer3Labs, and Hackernoon included.",
